      "calling_convention": "__stdcall",
      "comment": "GetGameState - Returns the current game state value.\n\nClassification: Public API (Exported as Ordinal_10005)\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Load global game state variable g_dwGameState from address 0x6fabd230\n2. Return value in EAX register to caller\n\nParameters:\n- None (void function with no parameters)\n- IMPLICIT: None\n\nReturns:\n- uint: Current game state value stored in g_dwGameState global\n- Value represents game execution state used by game logic\n\nCallers:\n- External references via ordinal export 10005\n- Referenced from entry point table\n\nNotes:\n- Simple 2-instruction leaf function with no side effects\n- Exported for external modules to query current game state\n- No error conditions possible - always returns valid state value",
