      "name": "GetColorDepth",
      "signature": "int GetColorDepth(void)",
      "calling_convention": "__stdcall",
      "comment": "Returns the current display color depth setting.\n\nExported as D2GFX ordinal 10007.\n\nClassification: Leaf function / Public API getter\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Load g_nColorDepth global variable value into EAX\n2. Return to caller\n\nParameters:\n- (none)\n\nReturns:\n- int: Color depth value (8, 16, 24, or 32 bits per pixel)\n\nCross-References:\n- InitializeGraphicsSystem: Sets initial value\n- SetColorDepth (ordinal 10008): Writes new value\n- GetBitsPerPixel (ordinal 10010): Also reads this value",
