      "name": "FOG_GetGlobalFlag",
      "signature": "uint FOG_GetGlobalFlag(void)",
      "calling_convention": "__stdcall",
      "comment": "Returns the current value of the global flag.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Load the global flag value from g_fGlobalFlag (0x6faae1a4)\n2. Return value in EAX register\n\nParameters:\n- None\n\nReturns:\n- uint: Current value of g_fGlobalFlag (0 = false, non-zero = true)\n\nFunction Classification: Leaf function (simple getter)\n\nRelated Functions:\n- FOG_ToggleGlobalFlag (Ordinal 10012): Inverts the flag state\n- FOG_SetGlobalFlag (Ordinal 10014): Sets flag to specified value\n\nNotes:\n- Part of a getter/setter/toggle triad for boolean flag management\n- Flag stored as uint but semantically boolean\n- Exported as Ordinal 10013",
