      "name": "GetFlagState",
      "signature": "uint GetFlagState(void)",
      "calling_convention": "__stdcall",
      "comment": "Returns the current global flag state value.\n\nClassification: Leaf function / Public API getter\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Load value from global g_dwFlagState (0x6faae198)\n2. Return loaded value in EAX\n\nParameters:\nNone - this is a parameterless getter function\n\nReturns:\nuint - Current flag state value\n  0 = flag disabled/cleared\n  non-zero = flag enabled/set\n\nRelated Functions:\nOrdinal_10015 (ToggleFlagState): Inverts the flag (0->1, non-zero->0)\nOrdinal_10017 (SetFlagState): Sets flag to specified value\n\nMemory Model:\nReads from global g_dwFlagState at 0x6faae198\nThread-safe for single reads (DWORD-aligned atomic read on x86)",
      "name_source": "LoD/1.07",
      "method": "MNE",
