      "calling_convention": "__stdcall",
      "comment": "Sets the global flag state value.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Read dwFlags parameter from stack [ESP+4]\n2. Store value to global g_dwFlagState at 0x6faae198\n3. Return to caller (stdcall cleans 4 bytes)\n\nParameters:\n- dwFlags (dword): Flag value to store in global state\n\nReturns:\n- void\n\nRelated Functions:\n- GetFlagState (Ordinal 10016): Returns current g_dwFlagState value\n- GFX_ToggleFlagState: Toggles g_dwFlagState between 0 and 1\n\nExported As:\n- Ordinal 10017",
