      "comment": "Graphics Interface Virtual Method Dispatcher (Vtable Offset 0x5C)\n\nTHUNK FUNCTION: Dispatches to graphics interface vtable method at offset 0x5C (index 23).\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Load g_pGfxInterface global pointer from 0x6fabd21c\n2. Jump to vtable method at offset 0x5C (23rd entry)\n\nParameters: None\n\nReturns: Depends on underlying vtable method implementation\n\nGlobal Dependencies:\n- g_pGfxInterface (0x6fabd21c): Pointer to graphics interface vtable\n\nNotes:\n- Exported as Ordinal_10019\n- Uses JMP dispatch (tail call) - return value passes through from callee\n- Vtable offset 0x5C = 92 bytes = index 23 (4-byte pointer entries)",
