      "name": "GfxInterface_CallMethod0x28",
      "signature": "void GfxInterface_CallMethod0x28(dword dwParam)",
      "calling_convention": "__stdcall",
      "comment": "Graphics Interface Virtual Method Dispatcher (Vtable Offset 0x28)\n\nTHUNK FUNCTION: Dispatches to graphics interface vtable method at offset 0x28 (index 10).\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Load g_pGfxInterface global pointer from 0x6fabd21c into EAX\n2. Load stack parameter [ESP+4] into ECX (passes to virtual call via thiscall)\n3. Call vtable method at offset 0x28 (10th entry, 40 bytes from vtable base)\n4. Return with stack cleanup (stdcall, 4 bytes)\n\nParameters:\n- dwParam (dword): Parameter passed to virtual method via ECX register\n\nReturns:\n- void (return value from virtual method in EAX passes through to caller)\n\nGlobal Dependencies:\n- g_pGfxInterface (0x6fabd21c): Pointer to graphics interface vtable\n\nVtable Layout Reference:\n- Offset 0x28 = 40 bytes = vtable index 10 (4-byte pointer entries)\n\nNotes:\n- Exported as Ordinal 10046\n- Uses CALL dispatch with RET 0x4 (stdcall convention)\n- ECX receives dwParam for thiscall convention to virtual method",
      "name_source": "LoD/1.07",
      "method": "MNE",
      "index": "MNE:c926c5fa3561290d7d9e247edf967da1",
