      "name": "GfxApplySettings",
      "signature": "void GfxApplySettings(uint * pdwSource)",
      "calling_convention": "__stdcall",
      "comment": "Copies 256 dwords from source buffer to graphics destination buffer, then invokes graphics refresh.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Test if source pointer is NULL\n2. If NULL, skip copy and go to refresh\n3. Copy 256 dwords (1024 bytes) from source to destination\n4. Invoke graphics refresh callback\n\nParameters:\n- pdwSource (uint*): Source buffer, NULL skips copy\n\nReturns:\n- void\n\nRelated Functions:\n- Graphics refresh callback via g_pGfxInterface[0x70]",
