      "name": "GfxInterface_CallMethod0xCC",
      "signature": "void GfxInterface_CallMethod0xCC(dword dwContext1, dword dwContext2, dword dwArg1, dword dwArg2)",
      "calling_convention": "__stdcall",
      "comment": "Graphics Interface Virtual Method Dispatcher (Vtable Offset 0xCC)\n\nTHUNK FUNCTION: Dispatches to graphics interface vtable method at offset 0xCC (index 51).\nConverts __stdcall calling convention to __fastcall for the underlying vtable method.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Load dwArg2 (4th param) into EAX\n2. Load dwArg1 (3rd param) into ECX\n3. Load dwContext2 (2nd param) into EDX\n4. Push dwArg2 onto stack\n5. Load g_pGfxInterface global pointer\n6. Push dwArg1 onto stack\n7. Load dwContext1 (1st param) into ECX\n8. Call vtable method at offset 0xCC with __fastcall convention\n\nParameters:\n- dwContext1 (dword): First context value, passed in ECX to callee\n- dwContext2 (dword): Second context value, passed in EDX to callee\n- dwArg1 (dword): First argument, pushed on stack for callee\n- dwArg2 (dword): Second argument, pushed on stack for callee\n\nReturns: void (return value from vtable method ignored or void)\n\nCalling Convention:\n- This function: __stdcall (cleans 16 bytes on RET)\n- Callee vtable method: __fastcall (ECX=dwContext1, EDX=dwContext2, stack=dwArg1, dwArg2)\n\nGlobal Dependencies:\n- g_pGfxInterface (0x6fabd21c): Pointer to graphics interface vtable\n\nNotes:\n- Exported as Ordinal_10070\n- Vtable offset 0xCC = 204 bytes = index 51 (4-byte pointer entries)\n- Referenced from export table at 6faad1b0",
      "name_source": "LoD/1.07",
