      "signature": "uint FOG_GetGameFlags(void)",
      "calling_convention": "__stdcall",
      "comment": "Returns the current game state flags from global storage.\n\nClassification: Leaf function / Public API (exported ordinal)\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Load game flags from global g_dwGameFlags (0x6faae490)\n2. Return flags value in EAX\n\nParameters:\n- None\n\nReturns:\n- uint: Current game state flags (g_dwGameFlags)\n\nRelated Functions:\n- FOG_SetGameFlags (Ordinal_10059): Sets g_dwGameFlags\n- FOG_10061 (Ordinal_10061): Also writes g_dwGameFlags\n\nCross-References:\n- Exported as Ordinal_10060\n- Referenced from 0x6faad188 (export table)",
