      "calling_convention": "__stdcall",
      "comment": "Wrapper function that calls a method from the graphics interface vtable.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Load graphics interface pointer from g_pGfxInterface global\n2. Call function at offset 0xa4 within vtable with three parameters\n3. Return to caller (stdcall - callee cleans stack)\n\nParameters:\n- dwUnused1 (uint): Unused parameter (may have been required by calling convention)\n- dwUnused2 (uint): Unused parameter (may have been required by calling convention)\n- dwParam1 (uint): First parameter passed to graphics function\n- dwParam2 (uint): Second parameter passed to graphics function\n- dwParam3 (uint): Third parameter passed to graphics function\n\nReturns:\n- void\n\nRelated:\n- g_pGfxInterface: Global graphics interface vtable pointer at 0x6fabd21c",
