      "name": "CleanupGfxAndResetDisplay",
      "signature": "bool CleanupGfxAndResetDisplay(void)",
      "calling_convention": "__stdcall",
      "comment": "Cleanup graphics and reset display settings on shutdown.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Verify graphics interface is initialized; assert if not\n2. Reset cursor display state if not already initialized\n3. Call graphics cleanup function via virtual function\n4. Destroy main window if created\n5. Restore display settings to default\n6. Return success status\n\nParameters:\nNone\n\nReturns:\n- true if all cleanup operations succeeded, false otherwise",
