      "name": "DispatchVirtualMethod",
      "signature": "void DispatchVirtualMethod(dword param1, dword param2)",
      "calling_convention": "__stdcall",
      "comment": "Dispatches a virtual method call through a vtable pointer.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Load global vtable pointer from 0x6fabd21c\n2. Check if pointer is valid (TEST EAX,EAX)\n3. If invalid, initialize vtable with FUN_6faa51d9(-1)\n4. Call function at offset 0x50 in vtable with two parameters\n5. Return via virtual method call\n\nParameters:\n- param1 (dword): First argument passed to virtual method\n- param2 (dword): Second argument passed to virtual method\n\nReturns:\n- Return value from virtual method (via EAX from callee)\n\nRelated Functions:\n- FUN_6faa51d9: Vtable initialization function",
