      "name": "SetVideoParameter",
      "signature": "void SetVideoParameter(int nEnable)",
      "calling_convention": "__stdcall",
      "comment": "Set video/graphics parameter based on enabled flag.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Get graphics interface pointer (g_pGfxInterface)\n2. If null, call assertion handler and initialize interface via FUN_6faa51d9\n3. Set global g_dwVideoParam to 1 if fEnabled is 0, else 0\n4. Invoke graphics vtable function at offset 0x2c\n\nParameters:\n- fEnabled (int): Flag controlling video parameter (0 or non-zero)\n\nReturns:\n- void\n\nMagic Numbers:\n- 0x2c (44): Offset to graphics function pointer in vtable",
