      "name": "RemoveItemFromQueue",
      "signature": "void RemoveItemFromQueue(int * pQueueItem)",
      "calling_convention": "__fastcall",
      "comment": "Removes an item from a doubly-linked queue structure and clears its pointers.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Load previous node pointer from [pQueueItem]\n2. If previous node exists:\n   - Load next offset from [pQueueItem+4]\n   - Calculate next node pointer (NOT if negative, else offset calculation)\n   - Link next node back to previous node\n   - Update previous node's next pointer\n   - Clear current item pointers to NULL\n\nParameters:\n- pQueueItem (int*): Pointer to queue item with [0]=prev_node, [4]=next_offset\n\nReturns:\n- void",
      "name_source": "LoD/1.07",
