      "name": "ProcessExit",
      "signature": "void ProcessExit(dword nExitCode, int nRunCallbacks, int nImmediate)",
      "calling_convention": "__cdecl",
      "comment": "Exit process with cleanup callbacks.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Call pre-exit hook\n2. If callbacks enabled (param_2==0):\n   - Walk exit callback function pointer array backwards\n   - Call each non-null callback\n   - Call cleanup functions for static exit lists\n3. Call final cleanup function\n4. If immediate flag set, call ExitProcess; otherwise return\n\nParameters:\n- nExitCode (dword): Exit code for process\n- bRunCallbacks (int): If 0, run exit callbacks; if non-zero, skip callbacks\n- bImmediate (int): If 0, call ExitProcess immediately; if non-zero, return normally\n\nReturns:\n- void (function does not return if bImmediate==0)",
