      "name": "LeaveCriticalSectionIndex13",
      "signature": "void LeaveCriticalSectionIndex13(void)",
      "calling_convention": "__stdcall",
      "comment": "Leaves critical section at index 13 in the critical section array.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Push immediate value 0xd (13) onto stack\n2. Call FUN_6faa5a81 to leave critical section at array index 13\n3. Pop return address and return\n\nParameters:\n- None\n\nReturns:\n- void\n\nRelated Functions:\n- FUN_6faa5a81: Leaves critical section at given index\n- ProcessExit: Calls this function during shutdown cleanup",
