      "name": "ExecuteFunctionArray",
      "signature": "void ExecuteFunctionArray(dword * ppfnStart, dword * ppfnEnd)",
      "calling_convention": "__cdecl",
      "comment": "Iterates through array of function pointers and invokes each one.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Initialize ESI to first function pointer (ppfnStart)\n2. Load function pointer from current array element\n3. Test if non-NULL (skip NULL entries)\n4. Call function via indirect call through EAX\n5. Increment pointer by 4 bytes\n6. Compare against end pointer; repeat until reached\n7. Restore ESI and return\n\nParameters:\n- ppfnStart (dword *): Pointer to first function pointer in array\n- ppfnEnd (dword *): Pointer to end of array (exclusive)\n\nReturns:\n- void (no return value)",
      "name_source": "LoD/1.07",
      "method": "MNE",
      "index": "MNE:f1060dff4c8b86b7cd32c42f8f136fb6",
