      "name": "EnqueueWorkItem",
      "signature": "dword EnqueueWorkItem(dword nWorkItem)",
      "calling_convention": "__cdecl",
      "comment": "Enqueues a work item into a thread-safe circular queue, expanding if needed.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Enter critical section\n2. Check if write pointer + item size exceeds queue capacity\n3. If full, expand by reallocating buffer and copying items\n4. Write item to current write position\n5. Advance write pointer by 4 bytes\n6. Leave critical section and return item\n\nParameters:\n- nWorkItem (dword): Work item value to enqueue\n- IMPLICIT: g_pbQueueBase, g_pbQueueWritePtr: Queue buffer pointers\n\nReturns:\n- Item value on success, 0 on allocation failure",
      "name_source": "LoD/1.07",
      "method": "MNE",
      "index": "MNE:b5756233a5a7628ebca8fed8bafffdce",
