      "comment": "Validates video mode data passed from Ordinal_10000.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Call FUN_6faa52db with video mode data pointer\n2. Convert boolean result to error code: (result != 0) - 1 maps to -1 (success) or 0 (failure)\n\nParameters:\n- pVideoModeData (void*): Pointer to video mode structure from caller\n\nReturns:\n- -1 on success (FUN_6faa52db returned non-zero)\n- 0 on failure (FUN_6faa52db returned 0)",
