      "name": "InitializeGameSession",
      "signature": "bool InitializeGameSession(dword dwSessionId, int nMode)",
      "calling_convention": "__stdcall",
      "comment": "Initialize or shut down the game session and world data.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. If nMode=1: Get version info, initialize world/skills/quests\n2. If nMode=0: Decrement session counter, cleanup if counter=0\n3. If nMode=3: Trigger game shutdown\n4. Returns TRUE on success, FALSE on failure\n\nParameters:\n- dwSessionId: Session identifier (unused)\n- nMode: Operation mode (1=init, 0=cleanup, 3=shutdown)\n\nReturns:\n- TRUE (1) on success, FALSE (0) on failure",
