      "name": "SehDispatcher",
      "signature": "void SehDispatcher(HandlerType * pHandler)",
      "calling_convention": "__stdcall",
      "comment": "Sets up and dispatches to exception handler with SEH frame restoration.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Save caller's EBP register\n2. Set up local stack frame\n3. Save volatile registers (ECX, EBX, ESI, EDI)\n4. Load handler pointer parameter and add offset 0xc\n5. Store adjusted offset in local variable\n6. Load current SEH handler from FS:[0x0]\n7. Retrieve and register previous handler\n8. Restore stack pointer from handler structure\n9. Restore base pointer from local variable\n10. Jump to exception handler code\n\nParameters:\n- pHandler (HandlerType*): Exception handler record structure\n\nReturns:\n- void (indirect jump to exception handler)",
      "name_source": "LoD/1.07",
      "method": "MNE",
      "index": "MNE:074c58384030e677416bb5e3943eefd6",
