      "name": "SaveSehFrame",
      "signature": "void SaveSehFrame(void)",
      "calling_convention": "__stdcall",
      "comment": "Saves current exception frame registers to global SEH state.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Store parameter (EBP+0x8) to g_dwSehReturnAddr offset\n2. Store EAX to g_dwSehExceptionInfo offset\n3. Store EBP to g_dwSehBasePtr offset\n4. Return from exception handler\n\nParameters:\n- IMPLICIT: EAX contains exception info value\n- IMPLICIT: EBP contains base pointer\n- IMPLICIT: Stack param at EBP+0x8 contains return address\n\nReturns:\n- void (exception frame context saved globally)",
      "name_source": "LoD/1.07",
