      "name": "InitializeSynchronization",
      "signature": "void InitializeSynchronization(void)",
      "calling_convention": "__stdcall",
      "comment": "Initializes global critical section objects for thread synchronization.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Initialize data lock critical section\n2. Initialize cache lock critical section\n3. Initialize memory lock critical section\n4. Initialize game state lock critical section\n\nParameters:\n- IMPLICIT: None (initializes global resources)\n\nReturns:\n- void\n\nNotes:\n- Called during game initialization to set up thread synchronization primitives\n- All four critical sections must be initialized before any threaded operations\n- Critical sections are cleaned up elsewhere (not in this function)",
