      "name": "InitializeLockedSection",
      "signature": "void InitializeLockedSection(int nSectionIndex)",
      "calling_convention": "__cdecl",
      "comment": "Initialize critical section at the given index with proper synchronization.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Check if critical section at index is already initialized\n2. If not, allocate 0x18 bytes for CRITICAL_SECTION structure\n3. Initialize the critical section and store pointer in global array\n4. Enter the critical section to acquire lock\n\nParameters:\n- nSectionIndex (int): Index into global critical section array\n\nReturns:\n- void (no return value)\n\nMagic Numbers:\n- 0x18 (24): Size of CRITICAL_SECTION structure\n- 0x11: Error code for allocation failure",
