      "name": "BufferStringToStream",
      "signature": "void BufferStringToStream(uint dwChar, int nCount, int * pnBytesWritten, int * pnStatus)",
      "calling_convention": "__cdecl",
      "comment": "Writes buffered characters to a stream, looping for a specified count.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. While nCount > 0, decrement nCount\n2. Call BufferCharacterToStream to write character to buffer\n3. Check pnStatus for error (-1 indicates failure)\n4. Exit on error or when nCount reaches 0\n\nParameters:\n- dwChar (uint): Character to write to stream\n- nCount (int): Number of times to call BufferCharacterToStream\n- pnBytesWritten (int*): Pointer to bytes written counter\n- pnStatus (int*): Pointer to status code (set to -1 on error)\n\nReturns:\n- void",
