      "name": "WriteCharacterCount",
      "signature": "void WriteCharacterCount(char * szBuffer, int nCount, int * pdwStreamPos, int * pdwStreamSize)",
      "calling_convention": "__cdecl",
      "comment": "Writes a specified number of characters from a buffer to a stream.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Check if character count is positive\n2. Loop for each character in the range\n3. Read character from source buffer\n4. Increment buffer pointer\n5. Write character to stream via BufferCharacterToStream\n6. Check stream status (0xFFFFFFFF indicates error)\n7. Return on error or after all characters written\n\nParameters:\n- szBuffer (char*): Source character buffer\n- nCount (int): Number of characters to write\n- pdwStreamPos (int*): Pointer to current stream position\n- pdwStreamSize (int*): Pointer to remaining stream size\n\nReturns:\n- void (returns early on stream write error)",
