      "name": "GetNextInt64Argument",
      "signature": "ulonglong GetNextInt64Argument(int * ppArgs)",
      "calling_convention": "__cdecl",
      "comment": "Retrieves next 64-bit argument from variadic argument list and advances pointer.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Load argument pointer from ppArgs\n2. Add 8 bytes to advance pointer past 64-bit value\n3. Load 64-bit value from original pointer location (8 bytes back)\n\nParameters:\n- ppArgs (int *): Pointer to argument pointer; modified to advance by 8 bytes\n\nReturns:\n- 64-bit argument value as ulonglong\n\nNotes:\n- Used by FormatStringParser for I64 format specifier (%I64d, %I64u, %I64x)\n- Advances ppArgs in-place for next argument retrieval\n- Loads from [EAX] and [ECX-8] where EAX=ppArgs, ECX=[EAX] after increment",
