      "name": "ReadFormatValue",
      "signature": "uint ReadFormatValue(int * pValue)",
      "calling_convention": "__cdecl",
      "comment": "Advances value pointer by 4 and extracts 16-bit word from 4 bytes prior.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Load pointer to value from stack\n2. Increment dereferenced value by 4\n3. Reload incremented value into EAX\n4. Load 16-bit word from (value - 4)\n5. Return constructed 32-bit result with high/low words\n\nParameters:\n- pValue (int*): Pointer to incrementable value\n\nReturns:\n- uint: 32-bit value combining high word and word at (value - 4)",
      "name_source": "LoD/1.07",
