      "name": "InitializeThreadLocalStorage",
      "signature": "uint InitializeThreadLocalStorage(void)",
      "calling_convention": "__stdcall",
      "comment": "Allocates a thread-local storage slot and initializes it with a thread context structure.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Call InitializeSynchronization() to set up synchronization\n2. Allocate TLS index via TlsAlloc(), verify index is not 0xffffffff (error)\n3. Allocate 8-byte context structure via FUN_6faa9c85(1, 0x74)\n4. Store allocated pointer in TLS slot via TlsSetValue()\n5. Initialize context: [0] = current thread ID, [1] = 0xffffffff\n6. Call FUN_6faa6981() with context pointer\n\nParameters:\n- None (no parameters)\n\nReturns:\n- 1 on success (TLS allocated and initialized)\n- 0 on failure (TlsAlloc failed or allocation error)",
      "name_source": "LoD/1.07",
      "method": "MNE",
      "index": "MNE:1563254ce315644019ac4e0b71caac74",
