      "calling_convention": "__stdcall",
      "comment": "Cleanup thread-local storage allocated during initialization.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Invoke CleanupCriticalSections to release sync objects\n2. Check if g_dwThreadLocalStorageIndex is valid (not 0xffffffff)\n3. Call TlsFree to release thread-local storage slot\n4. Reset g_dwThreadLocalStorageIndex to 0xffffffff (invalid)\n\nParameters:\n- None\n\nReturns:\n- void (no return value)\n\nRelated Functions:\n- InitializeThreadLocalStorage: Allocates thread-local storage\n- CleanupCriticalSections: Releases critical sections\n- TlsFree: Win32 API to free TLS slot",
