      "name": "InitializeHandlerFields",
      "signature": "void InitializeHandlerFields(dword pHandlerStruct)",
      "calling_convention": "__cdecl",
      "comment": "Initializes handler vtable and flag fields on a handler structure.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Load handler structure pointer from ESP+4\n2. Set field at offset 0x50 to point to g_pfnHandlerVTable\n3. Set field at offset 0x14 to 1 (enabled/initialized flag)\n4. Return\n\nParameters:\n- pHandlerStruct (dword): Pointer to handler structure to initialize\n\nReturns:\n- void\n\nMagic Numbers:\n- 0x50 (80): Offset to handler vtable/function pointer field\n- 0x14 (20): Offset to initialization/enabled flag field\n- 0x1: Initialization success/enabled flag value",
