      "name": "FreeGameSessionData",
      "signature": "void FreeGameSessionData(void * pSessionData)",
      "calling_convention": "__cdecl",
      "comment": "Deallocates game session data by releasing all pointers at fixed offsets.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Check if thread-local storage index is valid (not 0xffffffff)\n2. Retrieve session data from TLS if not provided as parameter\n3. Iterate through fixed field offsets (0x24, 0x28, 0x30, 0x38, 0x40, 0x44, 0x50)\n4. Release each non-null pointer via FUN_6faa7e03\n5. Release the session structure itself\n6. Clear thread-local storage value\n\nParameters:\n- pSessionData (void*): Session structure or NULL to retrieve from TLS\n\nReturns:\n- void",
      "name_source": "LoD/1.07",
      "method": "MNE",
