      "name": "ExtractPEVersionInfo",
      "signature": "void ExtractPEVersionInfo(uint * pdwVersion)",
      "calling_convention": "__cdecl",
      "comment": "Extracts major and minor version bytes from PE module header.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Clear output buffer to zero\n2. Call GetModuleHandleA(NULL) to get current module base address\n3. Validate PE signature 0x5A4D at module base\n4. Read PE header offset from module base + 0x3C\n5. Validate offset is non-zero and points to valid PE header\n6. Read major version byte from PE header + 0x1A into pdwVersion[0]\n7. Read minor version byte from PE header + 0x1B into pdwVersion[1]\n\nParameters:\n- pdwVersion (uint*): Output buffer receiving version bytes [major, minor]\n\nReturns:\n- void (output via pdwVersion parameter)\n\nMagic Numbers:\n- 0x5A4D: PE signature (\"MZ\" in ASCII, little-endian)\n- 0x3C: Offset in DOS header containing PE offset\n- 0x1A: Offset from PE header start for major version byte\n- 0x1B: Offset from PE header start for minor version byte",
      "name_source": "LoD/1.07",
      "method": "MNE",
      "index": "MNE:d8be7433da8984a6d08ceacc3367b90b",
