      "name": "InitializeProcessHeap",
      "signature": "int InitializeProcessHeap(int nUseFlags)",
      "calling_convention": "__cdecl",
      "comment": "Initializes the process heap and memory allocation manager.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Create heap via HeapCreate with flags based on nUseFlags parameter\n2. Query current allocation mode via FUN_6faa7110\n3. Branch on allocation mode:\n   - Mode 3: allocate 0x3f8 bytes via FUN_6faa7f74\n   - Mode 2: initialize allocation manager via FUN_6faa8abb\n   - Other: return success (1) immediately\n4. Check allocation result: NULL indicates failure\n5. On failure: destroy created heap, return 0\n6. On success: return 1\n\nParameters:\n- nUseFlags (int): Flags for HeapCreate; non-zero enables flags\n\nReturns:\n- 1 on successful heap and allocation initialization\n- 0 on heap creation failure or allocation initialization failure",
      "name_source": "LoD/1.07",
