      "name": "InitializeExceptionHandler",
      "signature": "void InitializeExceptionHandler(void)",
      "calling_convention": "__stdcall",
      "comment": "Initialize exception/crash handler with optional callback.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Check if handler state is 1 (enabled) OR (state=0 AND crash_handler=1)\n2. If condition met: Call FUN_6faa7396 with 0xFC (setup code)\n3. If callback registered, invoke it\n4. Call FUN_6faa7396 with 0xFF (finalization code)\n\nParameters:\n- IMPLICIT: dwExceptionHandlerState (global) - Handler enable state\n- IMPLICIT: fCrashHandlerActive (global) - Crash handler flag\n- IMPLICIT: pfnExceptionCallback (global) - Callback function pointer\n\nReturns:\n- void\n\nMagic Numbers:\n- 0xFC (252): Exception handler setup parameter\n- 0xFF (255): Exception handler finalization parameter",
