      "name": "CompareLocaleStringsWithFlags",
      "signature": "int CompareLocaleStringsWithFlags(byte * pbLocale1, byte * pbLocale2, dword * pdwFlags)",
      "calling_convention": "__cdecl",
      "comment": "Compares locale identifiers and validates flags.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Extract locale ID from first structure (+offset 4)\n2. If ID is null or empty string, return success (1)\n3. If ID matches second structure's locale, validate flags\n4. If IDs differ, compare strings at +offset 8\n5. If strings match, validate flags; otherwise return failure (0)\n\nParameters:\n- pbLocale1 (byte*): First locale structure\n- pbLocale2 (byte*): Second locale structure\n- pdwFlags (dword*): Flags to validate against structures\n\nReturns:\n- 1 if locales match and flags are valid, 0 otherwise\n\nNote: Validates flag bits 0, 1, and 2 as permissions/restrictions.",
