      "name": "SehHandlerSetup",
      "signature": "uint SehHandlerSetup(uint dwContextPtr, uint dwExceptionCode, uint dwAddressPtr, uint dwReturnAddress, uint dwStackPtr, int nFrameOffset, int nParamCount)",
      "calling_convention": "__cdecl",
      "comment": "Initialize SEH exception handling frame with context information and invoke exception handler.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Set up exception list chain (FS:[0] register)\n2. Store context pointer (dwContextPtr) at offset 0x1b in exception context\n3. Store address pointer (dwAddressPtr) at offset 0x1c in exception context\n4. Set safe value flag (0x1)\n5. Call SetupExceptionFrame with exception parameters\n6. Restore safe value flag to 0xffffffff\n7. Invoke exception cleanup handler\n8. Restore exception list and return\n\nParameters:\n- dwContextPtr (uint): Pointer to context information\n- dwExceptionCode (uint): Exception code value\n- dwAddressPtr (uint): Address information pointer\n- dwReturnAddress (uint): Return address on exception\n- dwStackPtr (uint): Stack pointer value\n- nFrameOffset (int): Frame offset on stack\n- nParamCount (int): Parameter count\n\nReturns:\n- uint: Result from SetupExceptionFrame (typically 0 on success)",
      "name_source": "LoD/1.07",
