      "name": "InitializeExceptionFrame",
      "signature": "void InitializeExceptionFrame(void)",
      "calling_convention": "__stdcall",
      "comment": "Initializes exception handler frame and validates SEH context structure.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Copy saved registers/context data to SEH frame\n2. Retrieve exception handler context via GetExceptionHandlerContext()\n3. Store handler context offsets at [EBP-0x1c] and [EBP-0x20]\n4. Validate exception context magic values and structure fields\n5. If validation succeeds, call abnormal termination handler\n6. Clean up and return\n\nParameters:\n- IMPLICIT: EBP contains saved frame pointer with context data\n- IMPLICIT: ESI contains exception frame pointer\n- IMPLICIT: EDI contains exception context structure\n\nReturns:\n- void\n\nMagic Numbers:\n- 0x28, 0x1c, 0x20, 0x24, 0x2c: Stack frame offsets for saved context\n- 0x1b, 0x1c: Exception handler context array indices\n- 0x1f928c9d: Exception context magic value #1\n- 3, 0x19930520: Expected context structure validation values",
      "name_source": "LoD/1.07",
      "method": "MNE",
      "index": "MNE:84f733a34932ba1d84f1e0708b18403c",
