      "name": "SetupExceptionHandler",
      "signature": "void SetupExceptionHandler(void)",
      "calling_convention": "__stdcall",
      "comment": "Initializes exception handling for SEH (Structured Exception Handling) frames.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Store locale-specific exception data and handler address on stack\n2. Link exception frame into FS:[0] exception chain\n3. If dynamic exception handler is available, call it and set status to 1\n4. Otherwise set status to 0xffffffff (failure marker)\n5. Call ExecuteExceptionHandler to process pending exceptions\n\nParameters:\n- IMPLICIT: FS:[0] contains current exception frame list\n- IMPLICIT: PTR_ExecuteExceptionHandler_6faae8f0 may contain dynamic handler address\n\nReturns:\n- void (exception handling setup only)",
