      "name": "CalculateIndexOffset",
      "signature": "int CalculateIndexOffset(int nBaseOffset, int * pOffsets)",
      "calling_convention": "__cdecl",
      "comment": "Calculates final offset by combining base offset with secondary index and array dereferencing.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Load second offset value from pOffsets[1] (secondary index)\n2. Add base offset to pOffsets[0] to get initial result\n3. If secondary index >= 0, dereference through array at offset and add to result\n4. Return combined offset value\n\nParameters:\n- nBaseOffset (int): Base offset to add to first array element\n- pOffsets (int*): Pointer to offset array [offset0, offset1, offset2]\n\nReturns:\n- Combined offset value (pOffsets[0] + nBaseOffset + conditional dereference chain)",
