      "name": "ExecuteExceptionHandler",
      "signature": "void ExecuteExceptionHandler(void)",
      "calling_convention": "__stdcall",
      "comment": "Executes a pending exception handler if one is registered.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Set up SEH (Structured Exception Handling) frame\n2. Query exception handler context\n3. If handler function pointer is set, invoke it\n4. Restore SEH frame and call finalization routine\n\nParameters:\n- IMPLICIT: Uses thread-local exception list via FS:[0]\n\nReturns:\n- void (no return value)\n\nRelated Functions:\n- GetExceptionHandlerContext: Retrieves handler context structure\n- ProcessSEHException: Entry point for exception handling",
