      "name": "FreeGamePages",
      "signature": "void FreeGamePages(int nPageCount)",
      "calling_convention": "__cdecl",
      "comment": "Frees virtual memory pages in a game data region, decrementing page count.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Iterate through pages in data structure starting at PTR_PTR_LOOP_6faae904\n2. For each 4KB page containing 0xf0 marker, call VirtualFree to deallocate\n3. Mark freed page with 0xffffffff, update free page counter\n4. Track minimum freed page address for optimization\n5. When all marked pages freed, call helper to compact structure\n6. Continue until nPageCount pages freed or linked list exhausted\n\nParameters:\n- nPageCount (int): Number of pages to free\n\nReturns:\n- void\n\nStructure Layout:\n- Offset 0x4: Next structure pointer\n- Offset 0xc: Minimum freed address tracker\n- Offset 0x10: Base address (or 0xffffffff if empty)\n- Offset 0x18: Compaction flag (0xffffffff when full)\n- Offset 0x2010+: Page status array (0xf0=allocated, 0xffffffff=freed)",
      "name_source": "LoD/1.07",
      "method": "MNE",
      "index": "MNE:4356a93c484fa354f7841c9d1d714a19",
