      "name": "ValidateAndAllocateMemoryBuffer",
      "signature": "int ValidateAndAllocateMemoryBuffer(int nPoolHandle, int * pAllocTable, byte * pnSizeField, dword nNewSize)",
      "calling_convention": "__cdecl",
      "comment": "Validates and allocates memory buffer in pool with size constraints.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Load current size from size field\n2. Calculate allocation table entry using pool index\n3. If new size < current size: Update size, adjust free space, mark modified\n4. If new size > current size: Validate buffer boundaries and zero-padding\n5. Update allocation table and return status\n\nParameters:\n- nPoolHandle (int): Pool context/handle\n- pAllocTable (int*): Allocation tracking table [entry, metadata]\n- pnSizeField (byte*): Current size value storage\n- nNewSize (dword): Requested new size\n\nReturns:\n- 1 on success, 0 on validation failure (size overflow or non-zero padding)\n\nMagic Numbers:\n- 0x18 (24): Allocation table base offset\n- 0x10 (16): Pool index offset for table calculation\n- 0xc (12): Bit shift for pool indexing (4096-byte units)\n- 0x3e (62): Buffer boundary limit\n- 0xf1: Modified flag marker",
      "name_source": "LoD/1.07",
      "method": "MNE",
      "index": "MNE:83295157daa32d8a2ec17bdc4754c492",
