      "name": "UpdateStreamState",
      "signature": "dword UpdateStreamState(dword nStreamId, int nUnusedParam, dword dwFlags)",
      "calling_convention": "__cdecl",
      "comment": "Updates stream state flags and handles stream initialization/finalization.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Validate stream index is within range and stream exists\n2. If valid, call stream prepare callback (FUN_6faaadce)\n3. Call stream operation handler (FUN_6faa962d) with flags\n4. Call stream finalize callback (FUN_6faaae2d)\n5. Return operation result\n6. If stream invalid, set error codes (9 and 0) in error containers\n7. Return 0xFFFFFFFF indicating failure\n\nParameters:\n- nStreamId (dword): Stream index to operate on\n- nUnusedParam (int): Unused parameter (always 0 in practice)\n- dwFlags (dword): Operation flags/mode indicator\n\nReturns:\n- Result from FUN_6faa962d on success\n- 0xFFFFFFFF on invalid stream\n\nMagic Numbers:\n- 0x24: Offset stride in stream descriptor array\n- 0x1F: Index mask for table lookup\n- 0x20: Bit position for stream existence flag\n- 0xFFFFFFFF: Error return code",
      "name_source": "LoD/1.07",
