      "calling_convention": "__cdecl",
      "comment": "Writes buffered data to an active stream with validation.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Validate stream index against stream count and check active bit in stream descriptor\n2. If valid: Call pre-write setup (FUN_6faaadce), write data (FUN_6faa9705), post-write cleanup (FUN_6faaae2d)\n3. If invalid: Set error code 9 and return -1\n\nParameters:\n- dwStreamId (uint): Stream index to write to\n- pbBuffer (byte*): Pointer to data buffer to write\n- dwSize (uint): Number of bytes to write\n\nReturns:\n- Bytes written on success (from FUN_6faa9705)\n- -1 on stream validation failure\n\nRelated Functions:\n- FUN_6faaaefe: Caller that manages stream output\n- FormatCharacterToStream: Character output that uses this for buffer flushes",
