      "name": "InitializeStreamBuffer",
      "signature": "void InitializeStreamBuffer(int * piStream)",
      "calling_convention": "__cdecl",
      "comment": "Initializes a stream buffer by allocating 4KB memory and setting structure fields.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Increment global stream initialization counter\n2. Allocate 4096 bytes (0x1000) using malloc\n3. Store allocated pointer in structure offset +8\n4. If allocation succeeds: set flag 0x8 at offset +12, set size 0x1000 at offset +24\n5. If allocation fails: set flag 0x4, use inline buffer at offset +20, set size 2\n6. Clear offset +4 to zero\n7. Copy buffer pointer to offset +0\n\nParameters:\n- piStream (int*): Stream descriptor structure pointer\n\nReturns:\n- void\n\nMagic Numbers:\n- 0x1000 (4096): Allocated buffer size in bytes\n- 0x08: Success flag (bit 3)\n- 0x04: Failure flag (bit 2)\n- Offsets: +0=buffer ptr, +4=zero flag, +8=malloc ptr, +12=state flags, +20=inline buf, +24=size",
      "name_source": "LoD/1.07",
      "method": "MNE",
      "index": "MNE:6db4eec4529d7320d9c182be8df08afa",
