      "name": "StreamHasAppendFlag",
      "signature": "byte StreamHasAppendFlag(dword dwStreamId)",
      "calling_convention": "__cdecl",
      "comment": "Checks if a stream descriptor has append mode flag set.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Validate stream ID against stream count\n2. Locate stream descriptor from table using stream ID index\n3. Read flags at offset +4 of descriptor\n4. Check if 0x40 (append flag) is set\n5. Return boolean result (0 if not set, non-zero if set)\n\nParameters:\n- dwStreamId (dword): Stream identifier index\n\nReturns:\n- Byte: Non-zero if append flag (0x40) is set, 0 otherwise\n\nMagic Numbers:\n- 0x24: Byte stride of stream descriptors in table\n- 0x1F: Bitmask for descriptor index within 32-item slot\n- 0x40: Append mode flag bit in descriptor flags\n- 0x05: Offset to flags field in descriptor",
