      "name": "GetErrnoPointer",
      "signature": "dword * GetErrnoPointer(void)",
      "calling_convention": "__stdcall",
      "comment": "Returns pointer to errno field in thread-local exception handler context.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Call GetExceptionHandlerContext() to get thread-local context base pointer\n2. Add offset +8 (2 DWORDs) to reach errno field location\n3. Return pointer to errno field\n\nParameters: None\n\nReturns:\n- DWORD * - Pointer to errno field at offset +8 in exception context structure\n\nSpecial Cases:\n- Relies on GetExceptionHandlerContext() returning valid thread-local storage\n- Errno field is at fixed offset +8 from context base\n\nStructure Layout (Exception Handler Context):\nOffset  Size  Field       Type    Description\n0x00    4     field_0     dword   Context field 0\n0x04    4     field_4     dword   Context field 4  \n0x08    4     dwErrno     dword   errno value (returned by this function)\n\nCallers: StringToLongInternal, UpdateStreamState, SeekStream, WriteStreamData, \n         FileWriteData, ConvertWideCharToMultiByte, and errno-related helpers",
      "name_source": "LoD/1.07",
