      "name": "AcquireStreamLock",
      "signature": "void AcquireStreamLock(dword dwStreamId)",
      "calling_convention": "__cdecl",
      "comment": "Acquires the critical section lock for a stream descriptor with lazy initialization.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Calculate bucket index from stream ID (dwStreamId >> 5)\n2. Calculate offset within bucket ((dwStreamId & 0x1F) * 0x24)\n3. Get pointer to stream descriptor from g_apStreamDescriptors\n4. Check if critical section is initialized (descriptor+8 == 0 means not initialized)\n5. If not initialized:\n   a. Acquire global stream lock (index 0x11) via InitializeLockedSection\n   b. Double-check initialization flag (prevents race condition)\n   c. If still uninitialized, call InitializeCriticalSection on descriptor+0xC\n   d. Increment initialization flag at descriptor+8\n   e. Release global lock via LeaveCriticalSectionByIndex\n6. Enter the stream's critical section at descriptor+0xC\n\nParameters:\n- dwStreamId (dword): Stream index used to calculate descriptor location\n\nReturns:\n- void (but stream descriptor is locked on return)\n\nStream Descriptor Layout (partial):\nOffset  Size  Field              Description\n0x04    4     dwActiveFlag       Stream active bit flag\n0x08    4     nCritSecInitCount  Critical section init counter (0=not init)\n0x0C    24    CriticalSection    CRITICAL_SECTION structure (RTL_CRITICAL_SECTION)\n\nMagic Numbers:\n- 0x1F: Mask for within-bucket index (32 descriptors per bucket)\n- 0x24: Stream descriptor stride (36 bytes)\n- 0x11: Global stream lock index for initialization synchronization\n- 0x08: Offset to critical section init flag\n- 0x0C: Offset to CRITICAL_SECTION structure\n\nThread Safety:\nUses double-checked locking pattern to lazily initialize per-stream critical sections.\nGlobal lock (index 0x11) protects initialization; per-stream lock protects stream ops.\n\nRelated Functions:\n- FUN_6faaae2d: ReleaseStreamLock - releases the critical section\n- UpdateStreamState, WriteStreamData: Callers that bracket operations with lock/unlock",
      "name_source": "LoD/1.07",
      "method": "MNE",
      "index": "MNE:89c8ec97483b3d89b792dc7acc8a9af7",
