      "name": "ReleaseStreamLock",
      "signature": "void ReleaseStreamLock(uint dwStreamId)",
      "calling_convention": "__cdecl",
      "comment": "Releases the critical section lock for a stream descriptor.\n\nCounterpart to AcquireStreamLock - releases thread synchronization after stream operations.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Extract bucket index from stream ID (dwStreamId >> 5)\n2. Extract slot index within bucket (dwStreamId & 0x1F)\n3. Calculate descriptor offset (slot * 0x24 stride)\n4. Calculate critical section address (base + offset + 0x0C)\n5. Call LeaveCriticalSection to release lock\n\nParameters:\n- dwStreamId (uint): Stream identifier used to locate descriptor\n  - Bits 5+: Bucket index into g_apStreamDescriptors array\n  - Bits 0-4: Slot index within bucket (0-31)\n\nReturns: void\n\nStream Descriptor Layout (0x24 = 36 bytes per entry):\n  Offset  Size  Field                Description\n  0x00    4     hFileHandle          OS file handle\n  0x04    4     dwFlags              Stream state flags (bit 0 = active)\n  0x08    4     nLockInitialized     Critical section init flag\n  0x0C    24    criticalSection      RTL_CRITICAL_SECTION structure\n\nRelated Functions:\n- AcquireStreamLock: Acquires lock before stream operations\n- WriteStreamData: Uses lock pair around FileWriteData\n- UpdateStreamState: Uses lock pair around SeekStream\n\nIndex Calculation:\n  bucket = dwStreamId >> 5 (divide by 32)\n  slot = dwStreamId & 0x1F (mod 32)\n  descriptor = g_apStreamDescriptors[bucket] + slot * 0x24\n  criticalSection = descriptor + 0x0C",
      "name_source": "LoD/1.07",
      "method": "MNE",
      "index": "MNE:4ebd25a652d48fc0c3275eab0a712286",
