      "name": "GetStringTypeExWrapper",
      "signature": "int GetStringTypeExWrapper(uint dwInfoType, char * lpszSrcStr, int nSrcLen, ushort * pwCharType, uint dwCodePage, uint dwLocaleId, int nPrecomposed)",
      "calling_convention": "__cdecl",
      "comment": "Wrapper for GetStringTypeEx that auto-detects Unicode or ANSI string type support.\n\nDetermines system string type capability on first call by probing GetStringTypeW then\nGetStringTypeA. Caches result in g_nStringTypeMode (0=uninitialized, 1=Unicode, 2=ANSI).\nSubsequent calls use cached mode to route to appropriate API.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Set up SEH frame with scope table at g_adwSehScopeTable\n2. Check g_nStringTypeMode for cached string type detection result\n3. If uninitialized (mode==0):\n   a. Probe GetStringTypeW with empty wide string\n   b. If Unicode succeeds, set mode=1 (Unicode supported)\n   c. If Unicode fails, probe GetStringTypeA with empty ANSI string\n   d. If ANSI succeeds, set mode=2 (ANSI only)\n   e. If both fail, return 0 (error)\n4. If mode==2 (ANSI only):\n   a. Use dwLocaleId if provided, else fallback to g_fConversionNeedsInit\n   b. Call GetStringTypeA directly with parameters\n5. If mode==1 (Unicode):\n   a. Use dwCodePage if provided, else fallback to g_dwCodePage\n   b. Calculate required wide char buffer size via MultiByteToWideChar\n   c. Allocate stack buffer via __alloca_probe\n   d. Zero-fill buffer with _memset\n   e. Convert MBCS to wide chars\n   f. Call GetStringTypeW with converted wide string\n6. Restore SEH frame and return result\n\nParameters:\n  dwInfoType     [in] - Character type flags (CT_CTYPE1, CT_CTYPE2, CT_CTYPE3)\n  lpszSrcStr     [in] - Source MBCS string to analyze\n  nSrcLen        [in] - Length of source string (-1 for null-terminated)\n  pwCharType    [out] - Buffer receiving character type values\n  dwCodePage     [in] - Code page for MBCS conversion (0 = use g_dwCodePage)\n  dwLocaleId     [in] - Locale ID for ANSI path (0 = use g_fConversionNeedsInit)\n  fPrecomposed   [in] - If nonzero, use MB_PRECOMPOSED flag (adds 0x8 to flags)\n\nReturns:\n  Nonzero (TRUE) - Success\n  0 (FALSE)      - Failed to get string type info\n\nSpecial Cases:\n  - First call triggers API detection via probing\n  - Unicode path converts MBCS to wide chars before calling GetStringTypeW\n  - ANSI path calls GetStringTypeA directly\n  - Stack allocation may fail if buffer too large (alloca overflow)\n\nGlobals Referenced:\n  g_nStringTypeMode      [RW] - Cached detection mode (0/1/2)\n  g_dwCodePage           [R]  - Default code page for MBCS conversion\n  g_fConversionNeedsInit [R]  - Default locale ID for ANSI path",
      "name_source": "LoD/1.07",
      "method": "MNE",
      "index": "MNE:a7046d73bbd286a50d5e7204509858d2",
