      "name": "FindExceptionSlotBySignal",
      "signature": "uint FindExceptionSlotBySignal(int nSignalNumber, byte * pExceptionSlotArray)",
      "calling_convention": "__cdecl",
      "comment": "FindExceptionSlotBySignal - Searches exception slot array for matching signal number\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Start with first slot in array (EAX = pExceptionSlotArray)\n2. Check if first slot's signal number (offset +4) matches nSignalNumber\n3. If match found at first slot, skip search loop\n4. Otherwise iterate through slots with 12-byte stride (0xc)\n5. For each slot, check signal number at offset +4\n6. Stop when: match found OR reached end of array (index >= g_nExceptionSlotCount)\n7. Final validation: verify found slot is within bounds AND signal matches\n8. Return slot pointer if valid match, otherwise return 0 (NULL)\n\nParameters:\n  nSignalNumber (int) - Signal number to search for (e.g., SIGFPE=8, SIGSEGV=11, SIGILL=4)\n  pExceptionSlotArray (byte *) - Base address of exception slot array from exception context\n\nReturns:\n  uint - Pointer to matching exception slot structure (12 bytes), or 0 if not found\n\nStructure Layout (ExceptionSlot - 12 bytes / 0xC stride):\n  Offset  Size  Field           Type    Description\n  0x00    4     unknown         uint    Unknown field (possibly flags or callback data)\n  0x04    4     nSignalNumber   int     Signal number for this slot\n  0x08    4     pfnHandler      code*   Pointer to signal handler function\n\nSpecial Cases:\n  - Returns 0 if no slot matches the requested signal number\n  - Returns 0 if search exhausts all g_nExceptionSlotCount slots\n  - First slot checked before loop for fast-path when match is at index 0\n\nGlobal Dependencies:\n  g_nExceptionSlotCount (0x6fab0e64) - Number of slots in exception array\n\nSSA Temporaries (compiler-generated, cannot be renamed):\n  uVar2 (pCurrentSlot) - Pointer to current slot being examined\n  uVar3 (pIterSlot) - Iterator pointer during search loop\n  piVar1 (pnSlotSignal) - Pointer to signal number field at offset +4",
      "name_source": "LoD/1.07",
